  "instructions": "Originally authored generic template, version 1. Choose each first actual working load in the workout; no starting weights or maxes are supplied. Working sets have a fixed illustrative 2 RIR target; effort does not calculate load. Add 2.5 kg after every completed exposure with every prescribed rep in every set; otherwise hold the load. After three consecutive exposures short of the load-rule success criterion, reset the last actual load to 90%, rounded to the nearest 2.5 kg, from the next day. Dates are projected by the selected cadence, not fixed weekdays. Review cadence and equipment before starting.",
